::  name       tube manifest field count
::  shape      fields - int (@u32)
::  invariant  the glow-publishing app-manifest mold (landed as the elder tube0
::  rung) carries four fields: name - version - capabilities - iteration-bound
::  example    4
::  readers    Pool - glow-publishing - Surface app room
::  nib        surface-p19-v0
::
::  Surface Chapter p19 -- second pedestal in src/app (Pool agents).
::  Names the glow-publishing app-manifest mold field count from
::  docs/glow-publishing.md.
::  Does not seat packaging - APK - NativeActivity - or revive pond/apps.
::  Source: linengrow/tube_manifest.rye -- the parameters of build(), which is
::  where the
::  mold's four fields are named. The Manifest struct itself holds seven, since
::  a fixed
::  buffer carries a length companion beside each of its two text fields.
::
+$  tube-manifest-field-count-shape
  $:  fields=@u32
